Add an `inspector` build option, and build without it.

Ghostty links Dear ImGui unconditionally for its terminal inspector, which the
app never shows, and the inspector's calls keep FreeType, libpng and zlib in
the executable too. Applied after the custom-shaders patch, whose lines it
edits.

From libghostty-spm's Patches/ghostty/0007-disable-inspector.sh (MIT, 2026 @Lakr233),
cut as a `git diff` against the ThirdParty/ghostty pin.

